{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"お久しぶりです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒ですヽ(・∀・)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前のブログの質問答えてくれてありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふるさとは自然がいっぱいというのが多かったですね〜(｡・д・｡)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もちろん都会のみなさんもいました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん教えて下さってありがとうだってばよっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/09/12/5709295/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生写真のやつ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう九月だというのに暑い！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちっとも寒くならない！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう生駒ちゃんは暑いのはいいんです早く冬になって欲しいんです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かわいいニットとか着たいんですヽ(・∀・)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もいもいもいもいもいもいもいもいもい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヽ(・∀・)ﾉヽ(・∀・)ﾉヽ(・∀・)ﾉヽ(・∀・)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"思考回路がショートしたよっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"氣志團万博のリハを昨日やりました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバー全員Zeppツアーで学んだ事を全て使って、乃木坂を知ってもらえる様に頑張るぞ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来るよっていう乃木坂ファムのみなさんは思いっきり楽しんで下さい！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/09/12/5709295/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう今年が終わりに近づいている。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年中にやりたい事って何だろ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年中にやりたい事！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒はナル坂46の活動ができるって